{"name": "Project ZETA", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"420\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778110/extras/18135a8218914a059577253c5bf4afc7.poster.avif?t=1787709640\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778110/extras/18135a8218914a059577253c5bf4afc7.webm?t=1787709640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778110/extras/18135a8218914a059577253c5bf4afc7.mp4?t=1787709640\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Welcome to the Aran Plateau.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is the tale of a strange world, tangled together from humans and humanoids, dragons and monsters, and heroes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An epic that began with a humble librarian piling pebbles upon ruins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Where will this story lead?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The answer starts unfolding now, here in the Aran Plateau.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"420\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778110/extras/39602e1097234bd5bfbfbf9fb8530640.poster.avif?t=1787709640\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778110/extras/39602e1097234bd5bfbfbf9fb8530640.webm?t=1787709640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778110/extras/39602e1097234bd5bfbfbf9fb8530640.mp4?t=1787709640\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Predict. Dash. Dominate.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Forget your aim. Move by judgment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Predict the enemy's next move, dodge their strikes, and pierce through their gap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The moment you steal their timing, the battlefield is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"420\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778110/extras/a1f3c6674e9ac08b8f10de6162c64918.poster.avif?t=1787709640\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778110/extras/a1f3c6674e9ac08b8f10de6162c64918.webm?t=1787709640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778110/extras/a1f3c6674e9ac08b8f10de6162c64918.mp4?t=1787709640\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>WHO DARES WINS.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 teams clash for a single victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight for it. Steal it. Or seize the moment while the others bleed each other dry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Turn the tide of the battlefield with your bold decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"420\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778110/extras/59f158ae61b5093e9465d3f8989a84b2.poster.avif?t=1787709640\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778110/extras/59f158ae61b5093e9465d3f8989a84b2.webm?t=1787709640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778110/extras/59f158ae61b5093e9465d3f8989a84b2.mp4?t=1787709640\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>YOUR CONTROLS. YOUR FIGHT.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mouse and keyboard or controller, jump in the way you play best.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Victory is decided not by your setup, but by you.</p> </div>", "short_desc": "Predict. Dash. Dominate. A 4-team Tactical Hero Arena where clever play meets original hero abilities without tipping the scale between controller and KBM. It\u2019s not a typical hero shooter, battle royale, or MOBA. It\u2019s Project ZETA. A Multi-team Tactical Arena.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778110/a4220ac73a077238c115b423205c8bd34135e727/header.jpg?t=1787709640", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Third Person", "Action", "PvP", "MOBA", "Tactical", "Multiplayer"], "developers": "Nirvanana", "publishers": "Nirvanana", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "2778110", "review_type": "Not Recommended", "curator_desc": "24 February 2025 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/2b4gXzugH3M", "first_seen": 1740351600.0, "review_rank": 1787}